<span id="A1.T8.1.12.3.1.2" class="ltx_p">Step 2: Identify the movies in which Taylor Swift acted. <span id="A1.T8.1.12.3.1.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_underline">The retrieved triples do not provide this information.</span></span>
