<span id="A1.T8.1.14.3.1.2" class="ltx_p">Step 2: Determine the movies Taylor Swift acted in. Based on the retrieved reasoning chain, Taylor Swift acted in ”<span id="A1.T8.1.14.3.1.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">The Lorax</span>”</span>
</span></td></tr>
