<span id="A1.T9.1.4.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:42.7pt;">
<span id="A1.T9.1.4.1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.T9.1.4.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Reasoning Logic</span></span>
</span></td>
<td id="A1.T9.1.4.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top" style="padding:1pt 4.6pt;" colspan="2">
<span id="A1.T9.1.4.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:426.8pt;">
<span id="A1.T9.1.4.2.1.1" class="ltx_p">Find the intersection of two sets: (1) regions that belong to the Mountain Time Zone, and (2) regions near the Grand Canyon.</span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A1.T9.1.5" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.T9.1.5.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top" style="padding:1pt 4.6pt;" colspan="3"><span id="A1.T9.1.5.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_leader"><span class="ltx_rule" style="width:100%;height:0.4pt;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span></span></td></tr>
