<span id="A1.T11.1.4.3.1.1.2" class="ltx_p">chain 1: {Country Nation World Tour, music.concert-tour.artist, Brad Paisley}, {Brad Paisley, owns, Nashville Predators}</span>
<span id="A1.T11.1.4.3.1.1.3" class="ltx_p">chain 2: {Country Nation World Tour, music.concert-tour.artist, Brad Paisley}, {Brad Paisley, attended, Belmont University}</span>
<span id="A1.T11.1.4.3.1.1.4" class="ltx_p">chain 3: {Country Nation World Tour, is hold by, Steve Bisciotti}, {Steve Bisciotti, attended, University of Alabama at Birmingham}</span>
<span id="A1.T11.1.4.3.1.1.5" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.T11.1.4.3.1.1.5.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Question:</span> Where did the ”Country Nation World Tour” concert artist go to college?</span>
